Hi {Owner},

I build websites for food trucks and trailers around {City}. {Business Name} has a following and good reviews, but no page that says where the truck is this week or lets a planner book it for an event.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a weekly stop schedule you update from your phone, the menu as text, a follow-the-truck sign-up and a private event form with headcount and date, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and help with the schedule. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on a day you're not parked?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
